- content_for :page_header do
  = render "layouts/components/page_header",
           title: "Comptes courants",
           links: [ \
             link_to("Ménages", finance_households_path, class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-gray-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-50"), \
             link_to("➕ Nouveau compte", new_finance_account_path, class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-gray-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:ring-offset-2") \
           ]

/ Filtre actif / inactif / tous — trois liens, pas de formulaire : l'état vit
  dans l'URL, donc il se partage et se recharge.
.mb-4.flex.items-center.gap-2.text-sm
  - { "active" => "Actifs", "inactive" => "Inactifs", "all" => "Tous" }.each do |value, label|
    = link_to label,
              finance_accounts_path(filter: value),
              class: "px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors #{@filter == value ? 'text-4s-main bg-teal-50 font-medium' : 'text-gray-500 hover:text-4s-main hover:bg-teal-50/60'}"

- if @accounts.blank?
  .p-6.text-sm.text-gray-500.bg-white.rounded-lg.border.border-gray-100
    p.font-medium.text-gray-700 Aucun compte pour ce filtre.
    p.mt-1
      | Crée un ménage puis son compte, ou un compte d'entité (Semisto, Low tech…).
- else
  .overflow-x-auto.relative
    table.w-full.text-sm.text-left.text-gray-500(data-controller="stacked-table")
      thead.text-xs.text-gray-700.uppercase.bg-gray-50
        tr
          th.py-3.px-6[scope="col"]
            | Compte
          th.py-3.px-6[scope="col"]
            | Type
          th.py-3.px-6.text-right[scope="col"]
            | Solde
          th.py-3.px-6.text-right[scope="col"]
            | Écritures
          th.py-3.px-6[scope="col"]
            | Dernière écriture
      tbody
        - @accounts.each do |account|
          tr.border-b.bg-white
            td.py-4.px-6.font-medium.text-gray-900[scope="row"]
              = link_to account.name,
                        finance_account_path(account),
                        class: "text-blue-500 border-b-2 border-blue-200 hover:text-blue-700 focus:text-blue-700"
              .mt-0.5.flex.items-center.gap-2
                span.text-xs.text-gray-400.font-mono
                  = account.code
                - unless account.active?
                  = account.status_badge
            td.py-4.px-6
              = account.anchor_label
            td.py-4.px-6.text-right.whitespace-nowrap(class="#{account.balance_css}")
              = account.balance
            td.py-4.px-6.text-right.text-gray-500
              = account.entries_count
            td.py-4.px-6.text-gray-500.whitespace-nowrap
              = account.last_entry
